{"id":"n1-107","title":"Noun を禁じ得ない (〜wo kinjienai)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"'Cannot help but do', or 'inevitable'","longExplanation":"The 〜を禁じ得ない (wo kinjienai) grammar point is used to express a situation or emotion that is so strong it can't be helped or is inevitable. It is used with nouns to express an uncontrollable feeling or action.","formation":"Noun + を禁じ得ない","examples":[{"jp":"この結果には驚きを禁じ得ない。","romaji":"Kono kekka ni wa odoroki o kinjienai.","en":"I can't help but be surprised at this result.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"結果","vocabId":"1254690","reading":"けっか"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"驚き","vocabId":"1238660","reading":"おどろき"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"禁じ","vocabId":"1241470","reading":"きんじる"},{"surface":"得","vocabId":"1454490","reading":"とく"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"そのニュースを聞いて、彼の成功を祝福する気持ちを禁じ得ない。","romaji":"Sono nyūsu o kiite, kare no seikō o shukufuku suru kimochi o kinjienai.","en":"Hearing that news, I can't help but feel the urge to celebrate his success.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ニュース","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"聞い","vocabId":"1591110","reading":"きく"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成功","vocabId":"1375690","reading":"せいこう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"祝福","vocabId":"1337520","reading":"しゅくふく"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"気持ち","vocabId":"1591430","reading":"きもち"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"禁じ","vocabId":"1241470","reading":"きんじる"},{"surface":"得","vocabId":"1454490","reading":"とく"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼女の美しさには感動を禁じ得ない。","romaji":"Kanojo no utsukushisa ni wa kandō o kinjienai.","en":"I can't help but be moved by her beauty.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"美し","vocabId":"1486360","reading":"うつくしい"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"感動","vocabId":"1212570","reading":"かんどう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"禁じ","vocabId":"1241470","reading":"きんじる"},{"surface":"得","vocabId":"1454490","reading":"とく"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼の話を聞いて、笑いを禁じ得ない。","romaji":"Kare no hanashi o kiite, warai o kinjienai.","en":"Hearing his story, I can't help but laugh.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"話","vocabId":"1600900","reading":"はなし"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"聞い","vocabId":"1591110","reading":"きく"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"笑い","vocabId":"1351280","reading":"わらい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"禁じ","vocabId":"1241470","reading":"きんじる"},{"surface":"得","vocabId":"1454490","reading":"とく"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}